# Node 18.12.0 (Windows Server 2012 R2) production compatibility.
# The only dependency that truly breaks the build on Node 18 (serialize-javascript
# using the global Web Crypto API) is pinned to 6.0.2 in package.json "resolutions".
# The remaining engine labels come from DEV-ONLY tooling (eslint 9 => needs >=18.18,
# @peculiar/x509 via webpack-dev-server => needs >=20) that is NOT executed during
# `yarn build`. Their engine fields are advisory metadata only, so we relax the
# engine check here to allow a clean `yarn install` (no CLI flag needed).
ignore-engines true
